  "comment": "Curated public-API registry for the Bridge API-feasibility path (bridge-plan-v3.md §7). Discovery happens ONLY within this list — open-web API hunting produces hallucinated endpoints. rate_limit_per_day values are the documented free-tier numbers as of 2026-08; they feed the collection-time arithmetic and should be treated as estimates. probe_url must answer an unauthenticated GET.",
